## Executive Summary

Q3 2024 delivered revenue of $41.2 million, representing 73.1% year-over-year growth and 12.0% sequential growth. This was our ninth consecutive quarter of 70%+ YoY growth. MedSync Payor momentum accelerated with 5 new enterprise deals closed.

### Key Metrics

| Metric | Q3 2024 | Q2 2024 | Q3 2023 | QoQ Change | YoY Change |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|------------|------------|
| Revenue | $41.2M | $36.8M | $23.8M | +12.0% | +73.1% |
| Gross Profit | $30.6M | $27.2M | $17.4M | +12.5% | +75.9% |
| Gross Margin | 74.3% | 73.9% | 73.1% | +0.4 pts | +1.2 pts |
| Operating Income | $3.5M | $2.5M | ($1.8M) | +40.0% | — |
| ARR (end of period) | $162.5M | $152.8M | $88.5M | +6.3% | +83.6% |
| Total Customers | 558 | 525 | 385 | +6.3% | +44.9% |

